{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1233951-quick-question-1e-edition-improvised-vs-rote","id":1233951,"title":"Quick question (1e edition) - Improvised vs Rote","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-11T05:06:34-07:00","id":1233951,"title":"Quick question (1e edition) - Improvised vs Rote","content":"Can you improvised only spell from your path primaries arcana?<br /> &quot;A mage can cast improvised spells by the dint of her path; [...]&quot;<br /> Or if you have the necessary arcanum dot to cast it whatever your path as long as you paid for the mana surcharge ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24373-malf12133","name":"Malf12133","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T06:39:06-07:00","id":1233974,"title":"","content":"Improvised casting has always only been free for your Ruling Arcana, whether from your Path or your legacy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T07:21:42-07:00","id":1233992,"title":"","content":"Ok..... What I mean is..<br /> Ex: an Acanthus with Life 1. Can he improvised cast any spell from life 1 or does he have to buy a rote for each spell to be able to cast it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24373-malf12133","name":"Malf12133","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T08:09:43-07:00","id":1234001,"title":"","content":"You can improvisationally cast any spell whose Arcana rating you meet. Knowing a rote just means you have studied a master's means of more effectively calling the imago to mind (and therefore casting with what is likely a larger dice pool).<br /> <br /> The Mana surcharge for improvisational casting is only if the spell's Arcanum is not one of your Ruling Arcana. So a Thyrsus can not only improvise any Life 1 spell, but she can do so for no Mana cost (unless the spell has its own cost). The Acanthus must pay Mana to do so, but if he knows a dot of Life, he may do so without knowing any rotes. If he knows a Life 1 spell by rote, he can cast that rote for no Mana cost (again, unless the spell has its own cost).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","user":"Stupid Loserman","date":". 07-11-2018, 11:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T08:15:10-07:00","id":1234003,"title":"","content":"Yeah you can improvise any spell that you have high enough Arcana to cast, always. If it's not a Ruling Arcana, you have to spend 1 mana just to cast it, in addition to any other mana you might need to use. <br /> Seeing as you'll likely have low rating in non-Ruling Arcana, Rotes are pretty strong in them, but you don't have to have them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23958-tengugrib","name":"TenguGrib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-11T10:13:01-07:00","id":1234038,"title":"","content":"Thanks a lot !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24373-malf12133","name":"Malf12133","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}